WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.558
The lasting takeaway is that the neural tangent
kernel framework,

00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:08.768
once used only for neural networks, applies to tree
models.

00:00:08.848 --> 00:00:16.045
The resulting Tree NTK explains many soft-tree
behaviors from one theory: training converges globally,

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:19.256
oblivious sharing costs nothing in the limit,

00:00:19.336 --> 00:00:22.966
deep trees degenerate into a nearly constant kernel,

00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:26.891
and harder splits yield a more useful nonlinear kernel.

00:00:26.971 --> 00:00:31.600
It also delivers a fast kernel whose cost is
independent of depth.
